{"data": [{"author_id": "2008832167477194753", "created_at": "2026-11-07T01:52:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118884159863361609"], "id": "2118884159863361609", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "继续实施适度宽松的货币政策：综合运用多种工具保持流动性充裕，使社融、货币供应量增长与经济增长、价格目标匹配；完善利率调控机制，降低融资中间费用；保持人民币汇率在合理均衡水平上基本稳定。", "url": "https://x.com/mashikeshibaba/status/2118884159863361609"}, {"author_id": "1850573774", "created_at": "2026-11-06T07:18:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118604014489407823"], "id": "2118604014489407823", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "下周3，10月CPI、PPI：决定市场情绪起点11月9日公布10月居民消费价格指数和工业生产者价格指数。CPI反映物价强弱，PPI反映工业品价格和企业利润空间。两项数据偏弱，消费、周期板块容易承压；物价企稳回升，则有利于改善企业盈利预期。下周还会陆续观察社融等金融数据，重点都是“经济有没有真正回暖”。", "url": "https://x.com/aborasheed2013/status/2118604014489407823"}, {"author_id": "1810526853888974848", "created_at": "2026-11-06T10:44:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118655719465423011"], "id": "2118655719465423011", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 86, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国人民银行（PBOC）已正式对 Solana（SOL）展开调查，重点排查其在上海商业区域未经授权的加密货币广告与推广活动。\n\n国内对加密货币推广的合规红线一直没有松过，这次央行直接针对公链团队的地推运作立案排查，对 SOL 来说是明确的监管利空，后续在内地的线下推广空间基本被堵死了。", "url": "https://x.com/web3xiaogongzhu/status/2118655719465423011"}, {"author_id": "1498310151002071044", "created_at": "2026-11-06T21:14:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118814392745906464"], "id": "2118814392745906464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 287, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Marek Jurek z LPR, to może od razu koń ??? Też LPR !!!! #agoraklarenbacha", "url": "https://x.com/AniaHahnn/status/2118814392745906464"}, {"author_id": "2023523057986662405", "created_at": "2026-11-07T07:00:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118961693401247907"], "id": "2118961693401247907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "PBoC says it halted Solana Accelerate China 2026 and will probe the entities and individuals behind Solana's Lujiazui tower ads, a PBoC official told Financial News. No company or person was named.\n\nhttps://t.co/TDoR0uvUnO\n#Solana $SOL #PBoC #CryptoRegulation https://t.co/1BKV9kdE4i", "url": "https://x.com/cryptowatchdesk/status/2118961693401247907"}, {"author_id": "2707611516", "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:39:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118623972665283011", "2118624358989979673"], "id": "2118624358989979673", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SAMSUNPOST\nRussian Foreign Ministry Releases Weekly Report on Ukrainian Armed Forces' Attacks\nAmbassador-at-Large of the Russian Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Rodion Miroshnik, has published the weekly report and photographic evidence detailing attacks attributed to the Ukrainian https://t.co/izfjhqEk9q", "url": "https://x.com/balkar_1977/status/2118624358989979673"}, {"author_id": "2009430739096584192", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:27:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118485327358967956"], "id": "2118485327358967956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The PBOC raised the FX reserve ratio to 6% from 4%, draining about $24bn and ending a 13-day yuan winning streak. The full piece shows why the fix gap narrowed from 661 to 373 pips, and the four triggers that could change the picture. https://t.co/ut1FpHO5kA", "url": "https://x.com/macro_soup/status/2118485327358967956"}, {"author_id": "1925341729", "created_at": "2026-11-06