i artırdı; alım serisi kesintisiz 24 aya ulaştı. Bloomberg HT'nin haberi.\nAltın, ekimde 4 bin dolar destek eşiğinin altına gerilemişti.\nMerkez bankası talebi fiyatlara destek sağlayabilir. #Altın", "url": "https://x.com/pgthaber/status/2118983303747244535"}, {"author_id": "4771665732", "created_at": "2026-11-07T08:35:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118985711927869514"], "id": "2118985711927869514", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 122, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China's PBOC just called $SOL promotions and related crypto moves a violation of local regs.\n\nThey're also going after any domestic firms tied to offshore issuance and trading platforms. https://t.co/f7Cuj726oY", "url": "https://x.com/Bianca_smx7/status/2118985711927869514"}, {"author_id": "2030732457528479745", "created_at": "2026-11-07T05:23:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118937348268269794"], "id": "2118937348268269794", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Çin Merkez Bankası, rezervlerine 25,8 ton altın ekleyerek kesintisiz altın alımlarını 24'üncü ayına taşıdı.\n\n📌 Kategori: Türkiye Piyasaları\n⭐️ Önem: 8/10\n📰 Kaynak: ForInvest / Foreks\n#Cin #Altin #PBoC", "url": "https://x.com/traderdostu/status/2118937348268269794"}, {"author_id": "413922121", "created_at": "2026-11-07T02:04:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118887341897208191"], "id": "2118887341897208191", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China’s PBOC says it halted Solana’s Shanghai Accelerate events and Lujiazui ads, and will probe domestic entities. Officials call SOL promotion illegal under Feb 2026 virtual-currency rules. #Solana #Crypto", "url": "https://x.com/aibarfasi/status/2118887341897208191"}, {"author_id": "27719086", "created_at": "2026-11-07T10:08:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119009113757589662"], "id": "2119009113757589662", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China’s central bank didn’t just cancel a conference.\n\nPBoC halted Solana Accelerate China events in Shanghai, called SOL promotion illegal, and said it will investigate the entities behind the Citigroup Tower ads.\n\nhttps://t.co/sTYAZmcrno\n\n#Crypto", "url": "https://x.com/kadrkn/status/2119009113757589662"}, {"author_id": "1903871403583324160", "created_at": "2026-11-07T14:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119067346094424480"], "id": "2119067346094424480", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🇨🇳 NEW: China’s PBOC says Solana promotions and related crypto activities violate local regulations.\n\nPBOC warns it will investigate domestic entities linked to overseas crypto issuance and trading platforms. https://t.co/KxmLIc7DmL", "url": "https://x.com/MuhammadMusa_89/status/2119067346094424480"}, {"author_id": "2707611516", "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:38:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118623972665283011", "2118624358989979673"], "id": "2118623972665283011", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SAMSUNPOST\nRussian Foreign Ministry Releases Weekly Report on Ukrainian Armed Forces' Attacks\nAmbassador-at-Large of the Russian Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Rodion Miroshnik, has published the weekly report and photographic evidence detailing attacks attributed to the Ukrainian https://t.co/Y9ZRggndrm", "url": "https://x.com/balkar_1977/status/2118623972665283011"}, {"author_id": "1920202735712153600", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:39:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119047022703497282"], "id": "2119047022703497282", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "China’s foreign exchange reserves rose to $3.405 trillion in October, up $4.9 billion from September.\n\nMore interestingly, the PBoC continued its gold-buying streak for the 24th consecutive month, lifting holdings to 78.30 million ounces. https://t.co/B4vWQbZcL8", "url": "https://x.com/anselemcrizyx/status/2119047022703497282"}, {"author_id": "1995313355171725312", "created_at": "2026-11-06T05:29:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118576460021858772"], "id": "2118576460021858772", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 438, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "想摆个摊、开个小店，手里就几万块启动资金，去银行一问贷款利率，很多人当场就打退堂鼓了。\n\n创业担保贷款就是冲着这个来的，个人最高能贷 30 万，最长 3 年，利率上限是 LPR 加 150 个基点，财政再贴一半利息。按 10 月的 LPR 举例，最高利率 4.5%，贴完自己只担 2.25% 左右，具体看银行批下来的数。", "url": "https://x.com/hodu382759/status/2118576460021858772"}, {"author_id": "25501714", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:15:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119056195839553934"], "id": "2119056195839553934", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1657, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118988727213027470", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "PBOC bought more \nChinese Gold Reserves 🇨🇳 https://t.co/Fo4Tn6cEA3 https://t.co/VLVszsnUV2", "url": "https://x.com/jameshenryand/status/2119056195839553934"}, {"author_id": "2113916154481639424", "created_at": "2026-11-06T14:24:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118711034105966742"], "id": "2118711034105966742", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "PBOC cites crypto promotion as its reason for stopping Solana’s Shanghai event.\n\nDid PBOC overreach, or did Solana cross the line?\n\n#SOL #Crypto #PBOC $SOL 👇", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoNewsScout/status/2118711034105966742"}, {"author_id": "135664132", "created_at": "2026-11-07T09:20:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118997023588544870"], "id": "2118997023588544870", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 6161, "like_count": 98, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 10}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118988727213027470", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "WGCのGopaulはPBOCの10月のゴールド買いは26トンですね。 https://t.co/yz1wXVL2JF", "url": "https://x.com/BruceIkeGold/status/2118997023588544870"}, {"author_id": "1916583572321828864", "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:04:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118856972992696709"], "id": "2118856972992696709", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "El Banco Popular de China confirmó  que detuvo  la serie de eventos “Solana Accelerate China 2026” e investiga a los responsables. La publicidad de Solana en la fachada del Citigroup Tower de Shanghái, visible desde el Bund, fue el detonante.  Tenía fechas en Shanghái, Hangzhou, https://t.co/4126RyFinH", "url": "https://x.com/juna_es/status/2118856972992696709"}, {"author_id": "843783976879886336", "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:42:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118624930455859372"], "id": "2118624930455859372", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 200, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Finansowanie LPR. @MZ_GOV_PL zapewnia o ciągłości działania, związki wskazują na problem systemowy.\nSzczegóły: https://t.co/G2OTdT70er https://t.co/ENdMKAYJyo", "url": "https://x.com/RynekLotniczy/status/2118624930455859372"}, {"author_id": "789121076676571136", "created_at": "2026-11-06T06:38:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118593801015161155"], "id": "2118593801015161155", 